  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specialist Health Care for refugees and vulnerable migrants in Cairo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategic objective of this project is to support the social development for refugees and forced migrants by addressing the health care needs of two of the most vulnerable groups of refugees, unaccompanied and separated girls and young women who are also mothers and their babies, and people who are suffering from renal failure.</narrative>
  </description>
